  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 07f4c7bb8ba526946812cf41a4598d2e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 2022224784}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1008782293}
  speakerText: {fileID: 1494510661}
  playerName: Oyuncu
  characterName: Hayrettin
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 2129468912}
  dialogueLines:
  - Merhaba.
  - "Merhaba.\nKalabal\u0131k biraz bunalt\u0131c\u0131 olabiliyor, de\u011Fil mi?"
  - "Evet.\nHerkes konu\u015Fuyor ama pek az\u0131 dinliyor gibi."
  - "Bu tip geceler b\xF6yledir.\nHerkes kendi hik\xE2yesini satmaya gelir."
  - "Siz de yazarlardan m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z?"
  - "Hay\u0131r.\nBen metinleri toparlayan taraftay\u0131m.\nEdit\xF6r\xFCm."
  - "Arif Naim ile \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 duymu\u015Ftum."
  - "Do\u011Fru.\nUzun s\xFCre birlikte \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131k."
  - "Bu gece nas\u0131ld\u0131 peki?"
  - "Sessizdi.\nNormalde fikirlerini saklamazd\u0131.\nAma bu gece\u2026\nsanki s\xF6ylediklerinden
    pi\u015Fmand\u0131."
  - "Pi\u015Fman m\u0131yd\u0131?"
  - "Son metni y\xFCz\xFCnden.\nYay\u0131mlanmas\u0131n\u0131 istemedim.\n\xC7ok
    ki\u015Fisel, \xE7ok a\xE7\u0131kt\u0131."
  - "O ne d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC?"
  - "\u201CGer\xE7ekler saklanmamal\u0131\u201D dedi.\nAma baz\u0131 ger\xE7ekler\u2026\nyay\u0131mland\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    geri al\u0131namaz."
  - "Bu y\xFCzden tart\u0131\u015Ft\u0131n\u0131z m\u0131?"
  - "Tart\u0131\u015Fma demeyelim.\nFikir ayr\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 diyelim.\nSonra
    k\xFCt\xFCphaneye ge\xE7ti."
  - "Yaln\u0131z m\u0131yd\u0131?"
  - "Ben g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCmde evet.\nBir \u015Feyler okuyordu.\nYa da okumuyormu\u015F
    gibi yap\u0131yordu."
  - Gergin miydi?
  - "Kararl\u0131yd\u0131.\nBu bazen daha tehlikelidir."
  - "Anlad\u0131m."
  - "Bu balolar bana hep garip gelmi\u015Ftir.\nMaskeler var ama\nkimse ger\xE7ekten
    saklanm\u0131yor."
  - "Te\u015Fekk\xFCr ederim."
  - "Rica ederim.\n\u0130yi e\u011Flenceler."
  - "Size de, iyi e\u011Flenceler."
  characterID: 5
